# This site needs NO secrets today, so there is nothing to fill in. This file only shows the pattern.
#
# If a secret is ever needed (for example a database key later):
#   1. Copy this file to a new file named `.env` (git ignores `.env` and will never upload it).
#   2. Put the real value there, in the form NAME=value
#   3. Never paste a real value into this example file, into the code, into a screenshot or into chat.
#
# On Cloudflare, secrets go in the dashboard (Workers & Pages -> your project -> Settings -> Variables and Secrets), not in a file.
#
# EXAMPLE_NAME=put-the-real-value-in-your-own-.env-file-only
